<title>NETHERLANDS: BANGERT UPGRADES UNILEVER EPS FORECASTS.</title>
<headline>BANGERT UPGRADES UNILEVER EPS FORECASTS.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Nov 11 research.</p>
<p>Company---------Sector--------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p>Unilever	  consumer prod 275.00  Banger Pontier</p>
<p>COMMENT: Hold (unchanged). The 1996 EPS estimates upgraded</p>
<p>to 15.00 guilders versus 14.80 and 1997 EPS upgraded to 16.30</p>
<p>guilders from 15.80. This is based on the ongoing volume</p>
<p>performance in the United States and the substantial margin</p>
<p>improvement in Europe. The stock trades at a 23 percent premium</p>
<p>to the Dutch market, based on our 1997 EPS estimates. We</p>
<p>consider the stock as fairly priced and therefore reiterate our</p>
<p>hold recommendation.</p>
<p>    Estimates (Dfl):   EPS	pvs	P/E     Dividend</p>
<p>    1995 (actual)	13.26		 n.a.    6.20</p>
<p>    1996		   15.00    (14.80)  18.3    6.90</p>
<p>    1997		   16.30    (15.80)  16.9    7.20</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (Fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
</text>
